Z||000000||FOCONE||09-05-2001||09:46 PM||||Just a brief note to let everyone know that the Fiero Owner's Club of New England's 5th Annual Fall Fiero show is nearly here.  The date is September 23 and the location is as always, Rutland, MA Community Center.  The Community Center is located on Glenwood Road at the intersection of Wheeler Road.<P>Preregistration will save you $4.00 if you get your registration postmark by September 10.  After that date there is no savings.<P>For a registration form please contact Chris Schaefer at chris.schaefer@focone.org.  He can E-mail, fax or mail you a copy.||||reg||10
